Smash your psiblades into the ground, creating a tide of crystallized leaves circling you in a radius of 3 for 7 turns.

All foes hit by the leaves will start bleeding for (5 + {{ctmd|5|35}}) per turn (cumulative).

All allies hit will be covered in leaves, granting them (10 + {{ctmd|3|25}})% chance to completely avoid any damaging attack (max 50%).

Damage and avoidance will increase with your Mindpower.

If you have two mindstars equipped, then:

* Damage will be multiplied by (1 + (Sum of Mindstar Base Damages) / 50 )
* Avoidance chance will be multiplied by (1 + (Sum of Mindstar Base Damages) / 112.5).
